{"id": "69596", "title": "相见无期", "author": "琵琶语", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 30, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69596.htm", "intro": "青晨：“你是我人生第一个男朋友。”\r\n 此刻正背着她慢悠悠爬山的钟蓝闻此脸沉了，不悦道：“你一生还想有几个？”\r\n 青晨不知悔改，依然不怕死的重复，你本来就是我人生第一个。\r\n 钟蓝闻言叹气，顿了顿说：“你应该说唯一。”\r\n \r\n 结局HE，在不久的将来男主会出现在新文里，这本书的最后也会补上一篇番外。原本就是这么设定的，大家原谅我吧！望天……\r\n 2014-4-19番外已经提前补上！只是艳阳高高照那本书里暂时还未出现钟蓝，所以当初的设定大概会修改一番。( ⊙o⊙ )\r\n 萌妻是颗糖系列新文连载中\r\n 我愿意系列民国旧影已完结\r\n 我愿意系列夏与冬已完结\r\n 我愿意系列暖情文已完结\r\n \r\n #favorite_1{color:#DC143C;font-weight:bold;border-style:double;}", "base": "files/article/html/69/69596", "chapters": [{"title": "第一章", "file": "10655887.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二章", "file": "10655888.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第三章", "file": "10655889.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第四章", "file": "10655890.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第五章", "file": "10655891.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第六章", "file": "10655892.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第七章", "file": "10655893.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第八章", "file": "10655894.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第九章", "file": "10655895.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十章", "file": "10655896.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十一章", "file": "10655897.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十二章", "file": "10655898.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十三章", "file": "10655899.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十四章", "file": "10655900.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十五章", "file": "10655901.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十六章", "file": "10655902.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十七章", "file": "10655903.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十八章", "file": "10655904.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第十九章", "file": "10655905.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十章", "file": "10655906.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二十一章", "file": "10655907.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22-25", "file": "10655908.h